    "detailed_description": "Hone your skills and try to perfect each of the challenges that will be thrown in your way.<br>And watch out, it gets really hectic.<br><br>Survival - Survive as long as you can on infinitely scaling levels!<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2714130/extras/cd8172977061f9b2f80ba5f9f0f40475.poster.avif?t=1736807485\" width=600 height=278 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2714130/extras/cd8172977061f9b2f80ba5f9f0f40475.webm?t=1736807485\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2714130/extras/cd8172977061f9b2f80ba5f9f0f40475.mp4?t=1736807485\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br>Boost Hunt and Survival Boost Hunt - Catch as many points as you can in limited time!<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2714130/extras/3174fd2993d1d14c84ca3802766c1d07.poster.avif?t=1736807485\" width=600 height=280 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2714130/extras/3174fd2993d1d14c84ca3802766c1d07.webm?t=1736807485\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2714130/extras/3174fd2993d1d14c84ca3802766c1d07.mp4?t=1736807485\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br>Race - Be the Fastest Around!<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2714130/extras/09403e10b39bba1852c97e2031e6d331.poster.avif?t=1736807485\" width=600 height=278 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2714130/extras/09403e10b39bba1852c9